flowchart TD
S([Save preference lists]) --> G[US-15 authentication and owner gate]
G --> V{Both submitted lists valid?}
V -- No --> E[400; keep prior lists]
V -- Yes --> P[Atomically replace dietary and allergen lists]
P --> Q{Lists empty?}
Q -- Yes --> C[Clear prior preferences]
Q -- No --> K[Store current selected values]
C --> R[200 saved preference object]
K --> R
R --> U[GET profile returns saved lists]
U --> F([Next generation uses these latest saved lists])
